                "Running marathons is challenging work. Runners need strong endurance levels. Training takes many long months. The race is forty-two kilometers. Finishing feels absolutely amazing always. Victory is sweet.",
                "Team sports require good cooperation. Players must communicate well together. Everyone has specific roles assigned. Working together brings success often. Trust between teammates matters most.",
                "Swimming is excellent full-body exercise. It builds cardiovascular endurance quickly. Water resistance strengthens all muscles. Proper technique is very important. Swimmers train very hard daily.",
